flowchart TD
    A([Mulai]) --> B[Client memiliki API Key]
    B --> C[Request GET /api/v1/laptops]
    C --> D{API Key ada?}
    D -- Tidak --> E[401 Unauthorized]
    D -- Ya --> F[Hash API Key]
    F --> G{Key aktif & cocok?}
    G -- Tidak --> E
    G -- Ya --> H[Update request_count & last_used_at]
    H --> I[Validasi query, filter & pagination]
    I --> J[Query PostgreSQL / Supabase]
    J --> K[Susun JSON response]
    K --> L([Selesai])
